{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a survivor game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through repeated choices, the character becomes stronger and stronger, and is fearless even when surrounded by monsters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game background is based on Chinese immortal cultivation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is an immortal cultivator, flying on a sword. He can fly to higher skies, and the difficulty of the battle increases accordingly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the protagonist will fly to the next level after a period of time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill enhancement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each skill has 3 to 4 upgrade directions. After the total level of the skill is full, it can be broken through. The breakthrough type is shared by all skills, so in theory, there are many final forms of the skill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content unlocking method</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new content through the talent tree in &quot;Unlock New Content&quot;, such as new skills, new maps, etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. You can unlock new content in &quot;Unlock new content&quot;, such as: new skills, new maps, new store items, new enhancements, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. You can perform off-site enhancements in &quot;Enhance&quot;.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Immortal Cultivator 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252190/d55f54ad30dffec5cfde205fc0687006130bce74.jpg"},{"name":"Immortal Cultivator 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252190/8fa07432f66ec886287129c37f5af3f7b93bda57.jpg"},{"name":"Immortal Cultivator 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252190/16d448daed707da3bbdac62a953968a21ff74c25.jpg"},{"name":"Immortal Cultivator 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommun